        "Description": "July 26, 2011, 5:00 PM, Bratislava, Slovakia. Good afternoon 47, your targets are now Howard Garcia, Xiang Guozhi and Ljudmila Vetrova. Eliminate all targets with Sniper Rifle. After you eliminate all targets, rendezvous with Mária Pietrová in Athens, Greece. Good luck 47!\rSources:\rhttps://www.cas.sk/clanok/203187/boj-o-zlatokopku-roka-zvrhne-veresova-z-tronu-durianovu/",
